    "detailed_description": "<u><strong><i>Welcome to Roodies Factory!</i></strong></u><br><br>This is the first game in the <strong>&quot;Roodies Factory&quot;</strong> saga.<br><br>Roodies Factory is a first-person horror mascot exploration game. In the game you are the ex-founder of <strong>&quot;Roodies Factory&quot;</strong> who returns to the factory years after it was abandoned in search of his missing brother...<br><br>Explore the abandoned factory, solve puzzles and find out what really happened 3 years ago when the factory was abandoned.<br><br><strong><u>Roodie</u></strong><br><br>Roodie is a tall animatronic clown who can think for himself. He is the main animatronic of <strong><u>Roodies Factory</u></strong>, he is also the most loved animatronic by children.<br><br><strong><i><u>Characteristics</u></i></strong><br><br>-Photorealistic Enviroment<br>-Horror Atmosphere<br>-Receive calls from NPCs<br>-Solve puzzles<br>-Explore the abandoned factory",
